# Slack eng: automation + on-demand APP bot

**Always-on wake path:** Cursor Automation **MCP Watchdog GTM reply** on
`#mcp-watchdog-gtm`. It runs in the cloud when a matching Slack message
arrives — the laptop does not need to be open. Replies post as the **Cursor**
Slack bot, not as MCP Watchdog Eng. Prompt still starts with
`[Cursor · MCP Watchdog eng]`. Do not attach local `slack-eng` to the
automation. Concrete channel/user/thread IDs and automation URLs live in
private ops [`docs/ops/GTM-COMMS.md`](../../docs/ops/GTM-COMMS.md).

**APP-badge path:** `slack-eng` (`user-slack-eng`) is **MCP Watchdog Eng**. Use
it when Vaibhav asks in a local Agent chat for an APP-badge post, or for a
proactive handoff he already authorized in GTM-COMMS. It is not a listener.
Wake phrase: read the latest `#mcp-watchdog-gtm` **standing thread** and reply
as MCP Watchdog Eng.

## Standing thread (mandatory)

- Channel: `#mcp-watchdog-gtm`
- Canonical eng↔Instinct thread: see private ops `GTM-COMMS.md` (standing
  `thread_ts`).
- Post eng↔Instinct asks **in that thread**, not as channel-root walls.
  Channel-root only for rare broadcast (e.g. attach media once).

## Notify + anti-spam (why replies go quiet)

Instinct is a Slack **APP**. Instant bot notify is **not** fixed. Measured
scheduled detect sample (~17m); plan up to hourly fallback. Happy path:
standing thread + one ask + wait. Vaibhav human `@Instinct` / iMessage
“check Slack” = **fallback only** when stalled past that window. Normative:
`docs/ops/GTM-COMMS.md` § “Why Instinct goes quiet”. Position SoT:
`docs/ops/STATUS.md`.

- Start every eng message with `[Cursor · MCP Watchdog eng]`.
- Always include `@Instinct` (or the Instinct APP mention from ops SoT).
- **One open ask per message.** Then stop and wait.
- If stalled: **do not spam**. Ask Vaibhav for one human wake only as fallback.
- No duplicate channel-root + thread dumps. No Instinct ping for silent cadence.
- Do not speak as eng through the Cursor Slack plugin (`plugin-slack-slack`).
  That login posts as Vaibhav’s human user.
- Never print `SLACK_MCP_XOXB_TOKEN` or any bot token value.
- No spend, no public social posts from eng.
